  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Spotlight Initiative 2.0 Programme in Zambia_Outcome A</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Programme will deliver a collective, comprehensive, integrated and gender transformative approach to promoting Gender Equality and Women Empowerment (GEWE). It will contribute to transformational and sustainable shift in social norms that produce and sustain GBV, especially Violence Against Women and Girls (VAWG) including domestic violence (DV) and intimate partner violence (IPV), and within the continuum of violence from home to work.</narrative>
  </description>
