    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Revised laws and gender equality policies</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Number of draft or revised laws and gender equality policies reviewed, strengthened, and harmonized to address gender-based violence and promote gender equality in alignment with international standards with input from Women&#x2019;s Rights Advocates.</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline year="2025">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Anti-GBV Act No. 1 of 2011 reviewed with support from ZLDC and Gender Division.
2. The Gender Equity and Equality Act not reviewed
3. The ZPS female Officers not sensitized on the national Gender Policy</narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2025-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2025-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
